I developed the graphical user interface (GUI) for the AI Data Management System, making it intuitive and efficient for handling AI-related data within an operating system. The system ensures seamless data organization, security, and real-time visualization, making AI workflows more accessible.

Key Features:
Data Organization & Storage

Manages structured and unstructured data with version control.

Supports databases, file systems, and cloud storage integration.

Data Preprocessing & Security

Automates data validation, filtering, and transformation.

Implements role-based access control (RBAC) for secure data handling.

Data Processing & Visualization

Provides real-time charts and graphs for data insights.

Displays system performance metrics and AI model training progress.

Integration with OS Components

Connects with system logs, resource monitoring, and user activity tracking.

Supports drag-and-drop functionality for easy data import/export.

AI Workflow Management

Automates AI pipeline execution and logs model training experiments.

Provides real-time monitoring and version tracking.

My Contribution – GUI Development
I focused on creating an interactive and user-friendly interface for the system:

Designed a dashboard with intuitive menus, buttons, and real-time updates.

Integrated drag-and-drop features for seamless data management.

Ensured accessibility, including dark mode and multi-language support.

Used responsive design for optimal performance across devices.
